      "article_type": "news",
      "title": "杰富瑞：中国大模型K3发布后智能与成本效率变化",
      "author": "KC桌面",
      "digest": "",
      "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8;\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;\">KC桌面——外资精译</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4;\">杰富瑞：中国大模型K3发布后智能与成本效率变化</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px;\">月之暗面发布K3模型后，JEF在一份最新研报中系统梳理了中国大模型行业的关键变化。核心判断是：中国模型不仅在智能层面首次在部分基准上领先美国模型，而且在成本效率上保持显著优势，这一组合正在改变市场对国内AI产业链的定价逻辑。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWp8GIXFVoanr9ArxoSFZQWENkk2TpXKlUQbDaCia4QozWGQeMNYU9siaYpBxbsU7adalaThgHl6b40hsfz2iaOia3OnVC8ibU3IaNk/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_01.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUaHRQbYIXPia7R9sPwr5W4DF3JjOrfGl84e475vhBmFOyXEX8FicTV4sHwXcictiaAJ5WzVEQOnQuZNQDq1PBZY48WJbUM9SZXn5Q/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_02.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUy7cJ6G7SdcQyAfdqHzOicKVBzvU6IjLVXhFCydKE3y91Qs4dXOLYiaZicCO5a4C1bG2XnRSqKMjYzgrl0zQ0gtGIKdOCdopVTx8/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"assets/source_image_03.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center;\"><img src=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOUicyI3f7JOUBicePc87HNSqiaxibCHI5TqyLQLCHsuDIAY2e5RDCrkYdQUaVhhDBibrNwAodLmlXxj58G3jgd8h3aFHJPPl2HEeqhY/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"KC Desk\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;\" /></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left;\">Original report: 48-JEF-China -PRC- - Internet-7 Takeaways Post K3 Release- Connect The Dots on Models- Cloud - Applications-260720</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600;\">更新信息参见ΚСⅾеѕk․сοｍ</p>",
